  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> satisfies the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is:</p>"
  },
